# Cursor workflow

This Cursor rule supplements the repository AGENTS.md instructions. It may add scoped requirements but may not weaken root security invariants.

**Authority:** root [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) §2

## Do not

- Edit before inspecting relevant files and listing target paths
- Expand beyond approved scope or auto-start the next phase
- Run `pnpm install` (or other installs) automatically
- Start long background tasks without approval
- Claim completion without inspecting the final diff
- Claim a command passed without executing it
- Commit, push, open/merge PRs, or use destructive Git commands
- Silently change security boundaries, vault formats, derivation paths, worker contracts, or dependencies

## Do

- Report exact commands and exact results
- Stop after the approved phase and wait for the next instruction

When instructions conflict, follow the stricter security-preserving rule and report the conflict.
